{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"3379","title":"Redmi Note 13 Series Expands with New Olive Green Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G","desc":"Xiaomi today announced the addition of a brand-new color variant to its Redmi Note 13 Series — the Olive Green Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G.","view_cnt":"20966","like_cnt":"11","add_time":"1718677797","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/289_operatorx_operatorx_opx/18/06/2024/c3db77a4994762910068c05d88d80a7b.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, CHINA, June 21, 2024\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e - Xiaomi today announced the addition of a brand-new color variant to its Redmi Note 13 Series — the Olive Green Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G. This launch follows the successful \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/discover/article?id=3140\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eglobal debut of the Redmi Note 13 Series\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e earlier this year on January 15, 2024, in Bangkok, Thailand. The series includes five diverse models — Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G, Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G, Redmi Note 13 Pro, Redmi Note 13 5G, and Redmi Note 13 — designed to cater to various market segments at competitive price points.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/874_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/18/06/2024/99e7bc1c01bc5dd8c82115dc2f5093cb.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note has built a solid reputation for delivering flagship-level features at accessible prices. Known for its powerful camera system, it has played a significant role in popularizing high-resolution photography in mid-range smartphones. In 2019, Redmi Note 7 pioneered high resolution in the mid-range smartphone segment with its 48MP camera. In the following years, Redmi Note 8 Pro introduced a 64MP camera, while Redmi Note 10 Pro advanced the trend with a 108MP camera, before Redmi Note 12 Pro+ 5G took this a notch higher, debuting Redmi Note's very first 200MP camera in 2023. The 200MP camera has extended to this year's Redmi Note 13 Pro models, while the Redmi Note 13 base models boast a 108MP camera. Furthermore, this ultra-high resolution camera in this year's Pro models is supported by optical image stabilization (OIS) for enhanced clarity and sharpness, along with 2x/4x in-sensor zoom for greater versatility in capturing distant subjects.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeyond its commitment to camera excellence, Xiaomi also prioritizes catering to user preferences with its Redmi Note series. Redmi Note 13 Series offers a range of colors\u003c/span\u003e¹\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e to suit diverse tastes, including the special edition Mystic Silver Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G, launched in celebration of Xiaomi Fan Festival, and adorned with an embossed Fan Festival logo. Today's new Olive Green variant, featuring a glossy finish, adds to the aesthetic appeal of the Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G lineup, and expands the palette of colors available to users by joining existing options such as Midnight Black, Ocean Teal, and Aurora Purple.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eNot only does Redmi Note offer enhanced choice to users, but more importantly these devices have been designed with user needs in mind. To name one example, Redmi Note series introduced ultra-fast charging to save time, while adding in large battery capacities to allow for uninterrupted usage throughout the day. Setting a new standard for fast charging in mid-range smartphones, Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G comes equipped with 120W HyperCharge, enabling users to charge their smartphone to 100% in a mere 19 minutes,\u003c/span\u003e²\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e while the other Pro models in Redmi Note 13 Series feature 67W turbo charging, taking just 45 minutes to charge to 100%.\u003c/span\u003e²\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Meanwhile, to provide users with more extended periods between charges, Redmi Note 9 first introduced a battery capacity of over 5000mAh\u003c/span\u003e³\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e to the series. This year, Xiaomi raised the bar further by equipping Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G with a massive 5100mAh battery,\u003c/span\u003e³\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e the largest in the series to date.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAt the same time, a vibrant viewing experience and smooth interaction, encapsulated in a durable design have also become steadfast features of Redmi Note. The introduction of a 120Hz AMOLED display in Redmi Note 10 Pro set the stage for seamless scrolling on a vivid screen, a feature that has carried through to all Redmi Note 13 models today. With a high peak brightness of 1800 nits on Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G, Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G, and Redmi Note 13, users can enjoy crystal-clear viewing, even in bright sunlight. Moreover, Corning\u003c/span\u003e®\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Gorilla\u003c/span\u003e®\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Glass Victus\u003c/span\u003e®\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e provides enhanced durability for Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G and Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G, offering peace of mind for users.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/958_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/18/06/2024/00d019e12c41bd7a129bdb64cd34b1ec.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBuilding on Redmi Note's commitment to offer flagship-level features at accessible prices, Redmi Note 13 Series presents a broad spectrum of options to cater to diverse user demands. Equipped with the same high-performance specifications as the other color options launched in January, the newest Olive Green Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G will be available in select countries and regions starting from 399 USD\u003c/span\u003e through Xiaomi's official sales channels, with pricing varying by region.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct images of the Olive Green option are available \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EusuPWE77TBFpr_iD-62ztsBansTloQqSke8JvNB2jAdOg?e=YPhtZ9\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehere\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor further information on Redmi Note 13 Series, please refer to the global launch press release \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/discover/article?id=3140\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehere\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e¹\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Specific color options may vary between markets.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e²\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Data from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e³\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e The value in mAh refers to the typical value of the battery capacity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eENDS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies, with its global smartphone shipments ranked among the top three and global MAU (including smartphones and tablets) reached 641.2 million in December 2023. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 739.7 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of December 31, 2023. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2023, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the fifth year in a row, ranking 360th.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"21014","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1718935205"},"common":null}